<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Dev 1996 net up 25 percent.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Dev 1996 net up 25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   6.57	vs  5.23</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    6.0	 vs  5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  1.36 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    6.36	vs  5.07</p>
<p>    Income			 11.13     vs  7.71</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guangdong Development Fund Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 2-6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 4</p>
<p>NOTE - London-listed closed-end investment company Guangdong Development had applied for a secondary listing on the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong on July 23, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of US$1.01 million on provision for permanent diminution in value of long term investments and loss of HK$0.35 million on expenses relating to the Hong Kong listing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
